      "text": "she is the whore of all the earth, 1 Ne. 14:10. church, which is the whore of all the earth, 1 Ne. 22:13. commit whoredoms, for they shall be thrust down, 2 Ne. 9:36. they who are the whore of all the earth, 2 Ne. 10:16. God hath commanded … not commit whoredoms, 2 Ne. 26:32. because of … whoredoms, they have all gone astray, 2 Ne. 28:14. the whore … must tumble to the earth, 2 Ne. 28:18. excuse themselves in committing whoredoms, Jacob 2:23. whoredoms are an abomination before me, Jacob 2:28. there should not be whoredoms committed among them, Jacob 3:5. supported … in their whoredoms, by the taxes, Mosiah 11:6. spent … their time with harlots, Mosiah 11:14. leading away … many … to commit whoredoms, Alma 30:18. commit whoredoms and all manner of wickedness, Hel. 6:23. Gentiles … shall be filled with … whoredoms, 3 Ne. 16:10. all lyings … and whoredoms, shall be done away, 3 Ne. 21:19. Turn, all ye Gentiles, from your … whoredoms, 3 Ne. 30:2. there were no … whoredoms, 4 Ne. 1:16. great pollutions upon the face of the earth … whoredoms, Morm. 8:31. whoredoms; wherefore he was cut off, Ether 10:11.",
